# Version bump

This project shows a build number in the taskbar (`vN` left of the computer name) and in Terminal `ver`.

**Every time you edit project code**, increment `APP_VERSION` in `desktop.js` by **1** before finishing.

- Only change the number at the top of `desktop.js`: `const APP_VERSION = N;`
- Do this once per task/session of changes, not per file
- If you forget, bump it when you remember before ending the turn
- Copy updated files to `C:\Users\finle\OneDrive\Documents\GitHub\PC` when syncing to GitHub Desktop (same as other project changes)
